# The clock-driven systems, staged: a slathered honey tree, a freshly planted
# berry, a Shaymin in its Sky form and one daily flag set.
#
# Four stations share this recipe and differ only in the `rtc` their spec boots
# them on, so what separates them is how much time the save has been shut for.
# Nothing here is reachable by pressing anything: the field runs sub_020559DC
# on map load, works out the difference between now and the save's own clock,
# and hands it to each system.

name CLOCKER
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 10000
money 3000
party SPECIES_SHAYMIN 30 ITEM_NONE
shaymin-form 0 SHAYMIN_FORM_SKY
berry 0 ITEM_CHERI_BERRY
honey 0 1440
flag FLAG_DAILY_WON_AGAINST_VALLEY_WINDWORKS_OUTSIDE_DRIFLOON
map MAP_HEADER_JUBILIFE_CITY 0xB4 0x309 FACE_DOWN
